      `[Work unit '${unit.id}': ${unit.title}] Part of the operation: ${ctx.objective}\n${role}${deps}${messagesBlock(messages)}\n` +
      `Task:\n${unit.prompt}\n\nCall task_completed with a concise summary when done.`
